          "text": "Conjugated dienes and trienes undergoing photochemical cyclization. (2E,4E)-2,4-hexadiene reacts with light through disrotation to form cis-3,4-dimethylcyclobutene. (2E,4Z,6E)-2,4,6-octatriene reacts with light through conrotation to form trans-5,6-dimethyl-1,3-cyclohexadiene."
